<title>USA: JMC Group says president resigns.</title>
<headline>JMC Group says president resigns.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>JMC Group said its president and chief operating officer, Brian Finneran, had resigned and would leave the company effective December 31.</p>
<p>Finneran's departure reflected the company's ongoing restructuring and consolidation, it said.</p>
<p>Chairman James Mitchell would reassume the duties of president and chief operating officer, the company said.</p>
</text>
